    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iby'urusengero rushya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka twari tumaze imyaka makumyabiri n'itanu tukiri abanyagano, mu itangira ry'umwaka ku munsi wa cumi w'ukwezi, hashize imyaka cumi n'ine umurwa ufashwe, muri uwo munsi ukuboko k'Uwiteka kwangezeho maze anjyanayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 21.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yangejeje mu gihugu cya Isirayeli ndi mu buryo Imana yerekesha abantu, angeza mu mpinga y'umusozi muremure cyane aherekeye ikusi ho kuri wo, hari igisa n'umurwa wubatsweho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 11.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nuko anjyanayo, ndebye mbona umuntu uhagaze ku irembo ishusho ye isa n'umuringa, afite umugozi w'imigwegwe n'urubingo rwo kugeresha mu ntoki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze uwo muntu arambwira ati “Mwana w'umuntu, rebesha amaso yawe, wumvishe amatwi yawe kandi ushyire umutima wawe ku byo ngiye kukwereka byose, kuko wazanywe aha no kugira ngo mbikwereke. Ibyo ubona byose ubibwire ab'inzu ya Isirayeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.6.1+1KI.6.2+1KI.6.3+1KI.6.4+1KI.6.5+1KI.6.6+1KI.6.7+1KI.6.8+1KI.6.9+1KI.6.10+1KI.6.11+1KI.6.12+1KI.6.13+1KI.6.14+1KI.6.15+1KI.6.16+1KI.6.17+1KI.6.18+1KI.6.19+1KI.6.20+1KI.6.21+1KI.6.22+1KI.6.23+1KI.6.24+1KI.6.25+1KI.6.26+1KI.6.27+1KI.6.28+1KI.6.29+1KI.6.30+1KI.6.31+1KI.6.32+1KI.6.33+1KI.6.34+1KI.6.35+1KI.6.36+1KI.6.37+1KI.6.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abami 6.1-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.1+2CH.3.2+2CH.3.3+2CH.3.4+2CH.3.5+2CH.3.6+2CH.3.7+2CH.3.8+2CH.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngoma 3.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nuko mbona inkike ikikije urusengero, n'uwo muntu ufite mu ntoki urubingo rw'urugero rwa mikono itandatu, umukono wose urenzeho intambwe y'intoki, maze agera ubugari bw'iyo nkike buba urubingo incuro imwe, n'uburebure bw'impagarike na bwo ari urubingo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko aza ku irembo ry'aherekeye iburasirazuba azamukira ku rwuririro rwaho, agera igikingi kimwe cy'irembo ubugari bwacyo buba urubingo incuro imwe, n'ikindi gikingi ubugari bwacyo na cyo ari incuro imwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akumba kose uburebure bwako buba urubingo incuro imwe, n'ubugari bwako ari indi ncuro, hagati y'utwo twumba haciye umwanya wa mikono itanu, ahanyurwa hafi y'ibaraza ry'irembo aherekera ku nzu na ho hari urubingo incuro imwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agera n'ibaraza ry'irembo aherekera ku nzu, riba urubingo incuro imwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze agera ibaraza rindi ry'irembo riba mikono munani, ibikingi byaryo biba mikono ibiri kandi iryo baraza ry'irembo ryari aherekeye ku nzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utwumba two ku irembo ry'aherekeye iburasirazuba twari dutatu mu ruhande rumwe, n'utundi dutatu mu rundi ruhande. Twose twari urugero rumwe, n'ibikingi byaryo by'impande zombi byari urugero rumwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agera ubugari bwo mu bikingi by'irembo buba mikono cumi, kandi uburebure bw'irembo buba mikono cumi n'itatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwanya wari uciye imbere y'utwumba wari mukono umwe mu ruhande rumwe, n'undi mwanya wa mukono umwe mu rundi ruhande, n'utwumba twari mikono itandatu mu ruhande rumwe, na mikono itandatu mu rundi ruhande. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze agera irembo ahereye ku gisenge cy'akumba kamwe ageza ku gisenge cy'akandi, ubugari bwaryo buba mikono makumyabiri n'itanu, amarembo yerekeranye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashyiraho n'inkingi agera mikono mirongo itandatu, urugo rugarukira ku nkingi kandi ruzengurutse irembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhereye inyuma y'ibikingi by'irembo ahanyurwa, ukageza ku ibaraza ry'irembo ry'imbere, hari mikono mirongo itanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utwo twumba twari dufite amadirishya akinzwe, two n'inkingi zatwo ziri ku irembo ry'imbere impande zose n'ibaraza. Amadirishya yari ku mpande zose z'imbere, inkingi yose iriho imikindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze anjyana mu rugo rw'inyuma mpabona utwumba n'imbuga ishashweho amabuye, bikikijeho urugo impande zose, kuri iyo mbuga ishashweho amabuye hari utwumba mirongo itatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mpande z'amarembo ni ho iyo mbuga ishashweho amabuye yari iri ihuye n'uburebure bw'amarembo, yari imbuga ishashweho amabuye yo hepfo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze agera ubugari uhereye imbere y'irembo ryo hepfo, ageza imbere ku rundi rugo ruri imbere haba mikono ijana, uko ari habiri iburasirazuba n'ikasikazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agera uburebure bw'irembo ry'urugo rw'inyuma ry'aherekeye ikasikazi, n'ubugari bwaryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utwumba two kuri ryo twari dutatu mu ruhande rumwe n'utundi dutatu mu rundi ruhande. Ibikingi byaryo n'amabaraza yaryo byari bihwanyije urugero n'irembo rya mbere, uburebure bwaryo buba mikono mirongo itanu, n'ubugari bwaryo buba mikono makumyabiri n'itanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
