          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amabaraza yaryo yari yerekeye ku rugo rw'inyuma n'ibikingi byaryo byariho imikindo iri mu ruhande rumwe no mu rundi ruhande, kuhagera hari urwuririro ruriho intambwe munani. ",
          "type": "text",
