              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ibikingi byaryo byari aherekeye ku rugo rw'inyuma, ibikingi byaryo biriho imikindo iri mu ruhande rumwe no mu rundi ruhande, kuhagera hari urwuririro ruriho intambwe munani.",
