          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ibaraza ry'irembo mu ruhande rumwe hari ameza abiri, no mu rundi ruhande kandi yandi abiri yo kubagiraho igitambo cyoswa, n'igitambo cy'ibyaha n'igitambo cyo gukuraho urubanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ruhande ruhera hanze, ahazamuka ho kunyurwa mu irembo ry'aherekeye ikasikazi hari ameza abiri. no mu rundi ruhande aherekeye ku ibaraza ry'irembo hari ayandi abiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ruhande rumwe hari ameza ane, no mu rundi ruhande yandi ane iruhande rw'irembo, ayo meza uko ari umunani bayabagiragaho ibitambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi hari n'ameza ane yaremwe mu mabuye yasatuwe ku bw'ibitambo byoswa, uburebure bwayo ari mukono umwe n'igice, n'ubugari bwayo ari mukono umwe n'igice, n'uburebure bwayo bw'impagarike ari mukono umwe. Ni yo baterekagaho ibikoreshwa byo kubagisha ibitambo byoswa, n'ibindi bitambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hari n'inkonzo, uburebure bwazo ari intambwe y'intoki zishimangiye ahakikije hose, ku meza hari inyama z'ibitambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyuma y'irembo ry'imbere hari utwumba tw'abaririmbyi mu rugo rw'imbere, twari iruhande ry'irembo ry'aherekeye ikasikazi twerekeye ikusi, kamwe kari iruhande rw'irembo ry'aherekeye iburasirazuba kerekeye ikasikazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze arambwira ati “Aka kumba kerekeye ikusi ni ak'abatambyi barinda urusengero, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'akumba kerekeye ikasikazi ni ak'abatambyi barinda igicaniro, ari bo bene Sadoki bo mu rubyaro rwa Lewi begera Uwiteka ngo bamukorere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze agera urugo uburebure bwarwo buba mikono ijana, n'ubugari bwarwo buba yindi ijana rungana impande zose uko ari enye, igicaniro kiri imbere y'urusengero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.47",
