        {
          "text": "Maze anjyana ku ibaraza ry'urusengero, agera inkingi zose zo ku ibaraza, mu ruhande rumwe haba mikono itanu no mu rundi ruhande yindi itanu, n'ubugari bw'irembo buba mikono itatu mu ruhande rumwe, na yindi itatu mu rundi ruhande. ",
