          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uburebure bw'umurambararo bw'ibaraza bwari mikono makumyabiri, n'ubugari bwaryo ari mikono cumi n'umwe, kuhagera hari urwuririro kandi ku bikingi by'irembo hari inkingi, imwe iri mu ruhande rumwe, indi iri mu rundi ruhande.",
          "type": "text",
